Z-STMCF03OHZiVDh2YlQ\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261120/1200395550789472256108624.jpeg/z1on-YldupYGQUMl7Lmi33SkwKTNRWJgbIXUfWyF1H0\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261120/1200395552882561024368592.jpeg/fI9zVZVzGgfLDS-7VTeJKjGnV9EDQKBrU55A5VOeQOU\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261120/1200395555189559296432708.jpeg/300Dm0Whn-4c7GekVRwkcaqsJevAs_LoDTcT0Q03E9E\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261120/1200395546179670016287496.jpeg/eNmRYIhP34S24PoNpmSZu6AXKjRuMVZuc5BLMHOQSzA\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261120/1200395548667023360481925.jpeg/qe8SJU_QDsSD3E_qAwhlyD96MH5g7gs7jIIp3IyCKdw\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261120/1200395551036936192927803.jpeg/edwDc9wGgcaMJ_rgYodQVclpe3sW_gHs-CMIOfgjCDk\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261120/1200395553138413568380569.jpeg/kDliomr6K2Y51bvAJXu6j6e7dG86_jUh-sTQTfrE0E0\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261120/1200395555411857408530721.jpeg/zSMSqXeGENKpvCH29T7HJ1kLozC9UW-IQJHOgECRzoA\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261120/1200395544514531328650418.jpeg/mqtWaWHBHcdQUMi76R15sLlGt1pAOSr17BJyeewScnk\"/><p>日期：2026年11月20日至11月26日（一連7日）</p><p>地點：全線香港及澳門 UNIQLO 門市及官方網絡旗艦店</p><p>註：所有優惠價格、商品庫存及贈品發送均以官方最終公布為準</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-21T01:23:51.245457+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1241,"images":51,"source":"HK01 熱話","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-21T00:00:10+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-21T02:17:28.295680+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-21T01:17:24.697464+00:00","content_hash":"de71bb2aa7c8dbf333cf9614e2a4d628eed7ac28a0c763161af3c87c59749662","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}